---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="FAQ — Good Apollo Goods" description="Frequently asked questions about Good Apollo Goods hats, sizing, materials, and orders.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Help / FAQ" title="A few useful answers." intro="The practical details about fit, making, care, and what is coming next." />
  <section class="container faq-list">
    <article><h2>How do I choose a child size?</h2><p>Measure the child’s actual head circumference and use the Child chart. Age is not the primary fit method.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Are the hats lined?</h2><p>Yes. Hats include cotton lining; exact outer and lining materials appear on every product page.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Why are quantities limited?</h2><p>Every piece is completed by one maker in a small batch. New batches are released periodically rather than produced after an order is placed.</p></article>
    <article><h2>How should I wash a hat?</h2><p>Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle, air dry only, and reshape while damp if needed. Avoid high heat.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Do you work with shops?</h2><p>Yes. Good Apollo Goods welcomes consignment and retail partnership inquiries from independent boutiques and other thoughtfully selected stockists.</p></article>
    <article><h2>Where are the hats made?</h2><p>Every piece is cut, sewn, and finished by one maker in Grand Rapids, Michigan.</p></article>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .faq-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 0 var(--space-16); padding-block: var(--space-section); }
  article { padding-block: var(--space-8); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  h2 { font-size: var(--text-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  p { color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
  @media(max-width: 700px) { .faq-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
